An unresolved reference in a cell reads the unescaped pipe

```
| [a\|b][m] |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>[a|b][m]</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| ![a\|b][m] |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>![a|b][m]</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| [x][r\|s] |

[r|s]: /u
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><a href="/u">x</a></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
